# Things specific to this project #
###################################
run/
input/era5
input/merra2
/input/country-data/DK/shape
*.nc
# Bundled synthetic example NetCDF for examples/run_minimal.py (small; overrides *.nc).
!examples/data/era5/era5_example.nc
*.png
# README references docs/img/*.png; keep those tracked even though *.png is ignored generally.
!docs/img/*.png
